  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> is one of the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the real root of this equation (where <math><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>) :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Ei7MV",
      "text": "Exists and is equal to <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "vKIHF",
      "text": "Does not exist",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sf5WH",
      "text": "Exists and is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x3TxE",
      "text": "Exists and is equal to  <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> in one of the roots, then <math><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> would be other.<br />Since coefficients of the equation are real.</p><p>Let <math><mi>&#947;</mi></math> be the third root, then product of roots <math><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />The value of k will come if we put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> in the equation<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Equation will become&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br />Hence roots exists and is equal to <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> &#39;</p>",
